 "mod": {
  "name": "PipelineAWPHarness",
  "author": "44M0N",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Verify-loop harness variant of PipelineAWP: the same five AWP parts, plus the auto grant/equip/camera phase machine and the status records bl2_verify reads. The grant forces every one of the part lists at once, so the test weapon is a whole AWP rather than an AWP barrel on a stock Jakobs body. The host is the Jakobs sniper: bolt action, no elemental slot, the highest base damage in the class. The AWP's own scope fills the sight slot, so it keeps EyeSocket1, bScoped and the Jakobs scope movie instead of having a stock BL2 scope bolted on top of it; the accessory slot is claimed by a part that draws nothing, so no bayonet, bipod or mount rolls onto it. The AWP is its own balance (Sniper_Jakobs_5_AWP, cloned from the Skullmasher's) with its own part lists, title, red text and CS2-derived stats on the barrel, and its own texture off the CS2 vtex files; Skullmashers stay Skullmashers."
 },
